# Migration progress

Webflow → Astro + Sanity, `www.tournewzealand.com`. Process: `webflow-sanity:migration` skill.

## Status

| Phase | State |
|---|---|
| 1 — Prepare | complete |
| 2 — Build | static pages done, assets localised, dataset imported and verified. **CMS routes remain.** |
| 3 — Audit | not started |

## Where it stands

**Done and proven, not asserted:**

| | Check |
|---|---|
| 22/22 static pages structurally identical to the live site | `npm run verify -- --cms` |
| no Webflow-hosted asset anywhere in the build; 149 local files | `npm run assets:check` |
| converter loses no visible character, on 7 real fixtures | `npm test` |
| serialiser round-trips every fixture | `npm test` |
| 85 documents imported, 246 images | `npm run sanity:import` |
| 93 rich-text fields identical character for character; every reference resolves; every hero image landed | `npm run sanity:verify` |

**Not done — this is what "can I publish" is waiting on:**

- **CMS routes (§6).** 71 of the 94 pages do not exist yet: `/tour/<slug>` ×29,
  `/tours/<slug>` ×11, `/area/<slug>` ×15, `/tag/<slug>` ×4, `/reviews/<slug>` ×11,
  `/news/<slug>` ×1. The six templates are extracted and their 30 list regions are mapped
  (`npm run seams`), but nothing is bound to the dataset yet.
- **The shared shell's own 9 collection lists** are currently frozen with the content they had
  at extraction time. They render correctly and will go stale.
- **Sitemap and redirects (§7).** Not started.
- **The engine (`engine/`) is still loaded from jsDelivr**, plus two CodePen-hosted scripts.
- **Cut-over (§8).** Not started. Both Wrangler routes are still commented out.

So: not publishable. The static site is real and correct; the CMS half of the site is not built.

Gaps in the migration skill found along the way are written up in
[MIGRATION-SKILL-BUGS.hd](MIGRATION-SKILL-BUGS.hd).

## Phase 1 — the site

- `_source/pages/` — 91 live pages, verbatim HTML (7.5 MB).
- `_source/assets/` — 609/609 Webflow-hosted assets, no failures (323 MB), including the
  Webflow CSS bundle, four JS chunks and the CloudFront jQuery.
- `_source/sitemap.xml`, `_source/manifest.json` — live sitemap and Webflow's own route/redirect manifest.

